  "description": "Office worker Jaeyeon Yoon finally decides to visit a dental clinic after years of running away. He gains this courage partly due to his interest in the kind and handsome dentist Jong-geun Lee, and visits the dentist after hours. Jaeyeon reveals to Jong-geun his issue with visiting a dentist normally, which is that his mouth is very, very sensitive. During the first check-up, Jong-geun experiences just what he means by this, when Jaeyeon lets out a very erotic moan. Jong-geun tries to push away his feelings for Jaeyeon since they are doctor and patient, while Jaeyeon tries his very best to flirt with Jong-guen. The start of a secretive after hour check-up between the dentist Jong-geun and the fatally sensual Jae-yun begins now!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3470347), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_mouth_wz), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/505013472), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/I_O_M), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/impurities_in_the_mouth), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=180243), [MComics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/webtoonComic/5523), Joara\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.wecomics.in.th/comics/12523)",
